### F-PLG-002 [P0] [Security] Product plugin signatures are demo-grade and forgeable

**Remediation status:** Fixed

**Remediation summary:**
Product marketplace signature verification now uses Ed25519 public-key verification against active trusted signing keys. Manifest-declared `signature_status: signed` is no longer trusted when no signing root exists; signed manifests without an active trusted key are treated as untrusted/invalid and denied by signature-required policy checks. Signing keys now store key type, trusted root ID, public-key fingerprint, and metadata. SDK manifest signing bytes were aligned to canonical JSON so Product can verify SDK-generated Ed25519 signatures.

